{
  "name": "Upload a CSV of names and company domains and download it with work emails",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Upload a CSV of names and company domains and download it with work emails\n\n### How it works\nA self-serve email finder for your team. The form accepts a CSV file with the columns first_name, last_name and domain. The workflow reads the file, keeps the first max_rows rows, asks Argorant for each work email and adds email, status (valid, catch_all, not_found and so on) and confidence to every row. The form then offers the enriched CSV as a download. Rows without a name or domain are skipped and cost nothing.\n\nCosts: 1 credit per email found, 0.25 per miss, capped by max_rows.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Set max_rows in **Settings**.\n4. Activate the workflow and share the production URL of **Upload form**.\n\n### Customization\nEmail the file to the uploader instead, or add a company column to the output.",
        "height": 558,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "0e9ec87a-47d9-43ac-9c28-26282d0663e2",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
